# The platform build context is this repository root, which also contains the
# checked-out platform/core sources. Keep metadata and generated artifacts out
# of the context so the resulting image digest depends only on source files.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.github
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
.rendered
